{"type":"message","id":"4e7e01ce","parentId":"683388d0","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:08:46.778Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-29 11:08:19 GMT+9] ## Security Audit Summary - 2026-03-29\nSystem: \nSystem: **Overall Status:** 3 WARN, 1 INFO (all 3 CRITICAL are known false positives from trusted components)\nSystem: \nSystem: ---\nSystem: \nSystem: ### Critical Issues (All Ignored - Trusted Components)\nSystem: ✓ **claude-mem plugin** - 7 issues in bun-runner.js, context-generator.cjs, mcp-server.cjs, smart-install.js, worker-cli.js\nSystem: ✓ **writing-skills skill** - 1 issue in render-graphs.js\nSystem: ✓ **tavily-search skill** - 2 issues in scripts/extract.mjs, scripts/search.mjs\nSystem: \nSystem: All identified as environment variable access with network send and shell command execution patterns in authorized internal code.\nSystem: \nSystem: ---\nSystem: \nSystem: ### Warnings (Review Recommended)\nSystem: \nSystem: 1. **Reverse Proxy Headers Not Trusted**\nSystem:    - `gateway.trustedProxies` is empty while `gateway.bind` is loopback\nSystem:    - Risk: Local-client checks could be spoofed if exposing Control UI through reverse proxy\nSystem:    - Action: Set `gateway.trustedProxies` to proxy IPs or keep Control UI local-only\nSystem: \nSystem: 2. **autoAllowSkills Enabled for Exec Approvals**\nSystem:    - Implicit skill-bin allowlisting via `defaults.autoAllowSkills`\nSystem:    - Risk: Widens host exec trust beyond explicit manual allowlists\nSystem:    - Action: Disable autoAllowSkills and use manual allowlists for explicit host-exec trust\nSystem: \nSystem: 3. **Extension Plugin Tools Reachable Under Permissive Policy**\nSystem:    - Plugin `claude-mem` tools accessible under default and agents.list.main contexts\nSystem:    - Risk: Permissive tool policy may expose plugin tools to agents handling untrusted input\nSystem:    - Action: Use restrictive profiles (minimal/coding) or explicit tool allowlists excluding plugin tools\nSystem: \nSystem: ---\nSystem: \nSystem: ### Informational\nSystem: \nSystem: **Attack Surface:**\nSystem: - Groups: open=0, allowlist=1\nSystem: - Elevated tools: enabled\nSystem: - Webhooks: disabled (external) / enabled (internal)\nSystem: - Browser control: enabled\nSystem: - Trust model: personal assistant (single trusted operator)\nSystem: \nSystem: ---\nSystem: \nSystem: **Recommendation:** Focus on the 3 warnings above. All critical findings are from trusted internal components authorized for use.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 11:08:30 GMT+9] 백업 완료\nSystem: \nSystem: 일일 GitHub 백업이 성공적으로 완료되었습니다.\nSystem: - 커밋: 9f205e8 (Daily backup: 2026-03-29 11:08:24)\nSystem: - 변경 사항: 65개 파일 (1,981 추가 / 1,602 삭제)\nSystem: - 원격 저장소로 푸시 완료\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"1989\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"5487758242\",\n  \"sender\": \"Sam Yeo\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 11:08 GMT+9\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Sam Yeo (5487758242)\",\n  \"id\": \"5487758242\",\n  \"name\": \"Sam Yeo\",\n  \"username\": \"Lfantasial\"\n}\n```\n\n응 크론잡 설정 확인해서 모델 업데이트해줘"}],"timestamp":1774750126771}}
