                (off|minimal|low|medium|high|xhigh)\n  --timeout <ms>                       Timeout in ms (default: \"30000\")\n  --timeout-seconds <n>                Timeout seconds for agent jobs\n  --to <dest>                          Delivery destination (E.164, Telegram\n                                       chatId, or Discord channel/user)\n  --token <token>                      Gateway token (if required)\n  --tz <iana>                          Timezone for cron expressions (IANA)\n  --url <url>                          Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to\n                                       gateway.remote.url when configured)\n  --wake <mode>                        Wake mode (now|next-heartbeat)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1194,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.3.24 (cff6dc9) — Your config is valid, your assumptions are not.\n\nUsage: openclaw cron edit [options] <id>\n\nEdit a cron job (patch fields)\n\nArguments:\n  id                                   Job id\n\nOptions:\n  --account <id>                       Channel account id for delivery\n                                       (multi-account setups)\n  --agent <id>                         Set agent id\n  --announce                           Announce summary to a chat\n                                       (subagent-style)\n  --at <when>                          Set one-shot time (ISO) or duration like\n                                       20m\n  --best-effort-deliver                Do not fail job if delivery fails\n  --channel <channel>                  Delivery channel (last)\n  --clear-agent                        Unset agent and use default (default:\n                                       false)\n  --clear-session-key                  Unset session key (default: false)\n  --cron <expr>                        Set cron expression\n  --delete-after-run                   Delete one-shot job after it succeeds\n                                       (default: false)\n 